{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o002a","title":"曹丕嗣丞相魏王位","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o002a-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"曹丕嗣丞相魏王位","evidence":["wendi-e-o002a-q"]},{"id":"wendi-a-p004-hanji","label":"裴注·袁宏汉纪","text":"《汉纪》载汉帝遣华歆授曹丕丞相印绶魏王玺绂并领冀州牧。","evidence":["wendi-q-p004-hanji"]},{"id":"huanchen-a-7fbd560b1d85acf13e5e","label":"正文","text":"矫陈宜割哀即位策太子即位大赦","evidence":["huanchen-q-93782fd59550b38e6b80"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-18f5c3dce604f019bbe0","label":"正文","text":"延康元年太祖崩，太子即王位","evidence":["cuimao-q-6724357e397c41e24a73"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"嗣位","evidence":["wendi-e-o002a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0072","role":"陈宜割哀即位、即具官备礼一日皆办","evidence":["huanchen-q-93782fd59550b38e6b80"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"崩者","evidence":["cuimao-q-6724357e397c41e24a73"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"建安二十五年，太祖崩后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"建安二十五年，太祖崩后"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o002a-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o002a-q","source_order":[2,3,"O002a"],"order":461}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0072","name":"陈矫","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-6724357e397c41e24a73","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-de953617adca4d22f61a","layer":"original","quote":"延康元年，太祖崩；太子即王位","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":299,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-93782fd59550b38e6b80","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-2cf96714962e97edc6f0","layer":"original","quote":"群臣拘常〖2〗，以为太子即位，当须诏命〖3〗。矫曰：“王薨于外，天下惶惧；太子宜割哀即位，以系远近之望。且又爱子在侧〖4〗；彼此生变，则社稷危矣！”即具官备礼，一日皆办。明旦，以王后令，策太子即位，大赦荡然〖5〗","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":350,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-e-o002a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-p004-hanji","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-b2c1a6e9fbf6d3cccd5c","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞袁宏《汉纪》载汉帝诏曰：“魏太子丕：昔皇天授乃显考以翼我皇家，遂攘除群凶，拓定九州。弘功茂绩，光于宇宙；朕用垂拱负扆，二十有余载。天不慭遗一老，永保余一人；早世潜神，哀悼伤切。丕奕世宣明，宜秉文武，绍熙前绪。今使使持节、御史大夫华歆，奉策诏，授丕丞相印绶、魏王玺绂，领冀州牧。方今外有遗虏，遐夷未宾；旗鼓犹在边境，干戈不得韬刃。斯乃播扬洪烈，立功垂名之秋也；岂得修谅*之礼，究曾、闵之志哉？其敬服朕命，抑弭忧怀；旁祗厥绪，时亮庶功，以称朕意。於戏，可不勉与！”","attribution":"裴注·袁宏汉纪","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":13,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f22d8002aa4c3dfdd6df","start":0,"end":233,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
